ositive safe-integer limits validate before network I/O; TOON is default and TOON/JSON/compact JSON/YAML/table/markdown outputs retain stable documented envelopes; Focused, full, coverage, docstring, type, lint, duplication, file-size, ShellCheck, audit, Trivy, package, setup wizard, PM, changelog, and non-publishing release gates pass"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"Feature hac-ln1v and approved plan hac-h3uj capture duplicate-safe lineage, research, privacy, and compatibility constraints"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"complete-home-assistant-api-coverage"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"implement-media-discovery"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Eliminates opaque hand-written WebSocket calls for media automation and agent planning."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Adds current media browsing and search coverage with bounded machine contracts."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Production-ready CLI commands merged with exact-head checks and zero unresolved reviews."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Home Assistant current development exposes searchable media sources that are absent from the typed CLI."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"hac-ln1v"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reviewer","value":"unbraind"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":96},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"2026-07-media-discovery"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"2026.7.26"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"hac-96i2","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T22:32:44.658Z"},{"id":"hac-ahl7","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T22:32:44.658Z"},{"id":"hac-ak9g","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T22:32:44.658Z"},{"id":"hac-c0y8","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-25T22:32:44.658Z"},{"id":"hac-h3uj","kind":"implements","creat